---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How CraftGrid Works | Step-by-Step Marketplace Workflow"
  description="Learn how CraftGrid connects businesses with website builders. From initial brief to milestone escrow release."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-12">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">The Process</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-dark tracking-tight">How CraftGrid Works</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-secondary">
        Whether you are commissioning a new online storefront or building custom sites for clients, CraftGrid keeps the entire relationship structured and transparent.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Clear Stages -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card flex items-start gap-5">
        <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-soft-primary text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg shrink-0">
          1
        </span>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-dark">Define Scope & Requirements</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Clients can either browse standardized Packaged Services (with predetermined pricing and turnaround times) or use our 5-step Project Wizard to post a custom brief outlining their preferred CMS, page count, and budget.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 flex gap-2">
            <a href="/services" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Browse Packaged Services →</a>
            <span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
            <a href="/post-project" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Post a Project Brief →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card flex items-start gap-5">
        <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-soft-primary text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg shrink-0">
          2
        </span>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-dark">Select Your Builder & Align on Milestones</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Review candidate proposals, examine past verified work in their portfolio modal, and establish 2 to 4 distinct project milestones (e.g. Wireframes, Frontend Build, Testing & Launch). Both parties agree on deliverables before any funds move.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card flex items-start gap-5">
        <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-soft-primary text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg shrink-0">
          3
        </span>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-dark">Fund Escrow with Peace of Mind</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Payment for each agreed phase is deposited into CraftGrid Escrow. Builders have peace of mind knowing the client is serious and funded, while clients maintain control because funds are only released after reviewing the work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-card flex items-start gap-5">
        <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-soft-primary text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg shrink-0">
          4
        </span>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-dark">Review Deliverables & Launch</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Inspect live staging links, test forms and mobile breakpoints. Request revisions if something is off-spec. Once satisfied, click "Approve Milestone" to release payment to the builder and celebrate your launch.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="text-center pt-4">
      <a
        href="/post-project"
        class="inline-block px-8 py-3.5 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md transition"
      >
        Start Your Project Now
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
